OL,3,GNEWSASheriff calls for better
OL,4,Acommunication over the risks of farmers
OL,5,Afalling from heights
OL,6,
OL,7,FBetter communication is needed over the
OL,8,Frisks of farmers falling from heights,
OL,9,Fa sheriff has said.
OL,11,FThe deaths of six men who fell at farms
OL,12,Facross Scotland were the focus of a
OL,13,Ffatal accident inquiry (FAI).
OL,15,FTwo of the deaths were in Aberdeenshire
OL,16,Fand the others were in Stirling, Mull,
OL,17,Fthe Borders and East Ayrshire.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
