OL,3,GNEWSASheriff calls for better
OL,4,Acommunication over the risks of farmers
OL,5,Afalling from heights
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn his determination, Sheriff Keith
OL,8,FO'Mahony said the Health and Safety
OL,9,FExecutive (HSE) should review how it
OL,10,Fcurrently communicated the risks of
OL,11,Fworking at height to those working in
OL,12,FScotland's agricultural sector.
